Single
= 

All
= 

Locator
= 

Maidenhead locator squares, in blue. Single shows the station's square, such as JO01en, and the bigger one it's in, such as JO01. All draws the grid over the whole map, finer as you zoom in.
= 

OS grid
= 

Ordnance Survey National Grid squares, in magenta, for Great Britain only. Single shows the station's 10 km square, such as TQ68, and the 100 km one it's in, such as TQ. All draws the grid over the whole map.
= 

Lat/Lon
= 

Show lines of latitude and longitude in yellow, closer together as you zoom in
= 

Whole world
= 

Street View
= 

Open Google Street View in your web browser at the middle of the map, to look around at street level
