Sync
= 

Checks this computer's clock against internet time (NTP).\nIn the demo it won't change it.
= 

Sets this computer's clock from internet time (NTP), for FT8, FT4 and the other timed modes.\nWindows may ask for permission.
= 

Then sets the radio's date, time and UTC offset from it, as the next minute starts.
